      </ul> </div> <!-- SINGLE CTA --> <div class="cta-section"> <h3>See ioNova ARS in action</h3> <p>The complete ISO 20022 Postal Address &mdash; Requirements and Specifications Update 2026 consolidates the CPMI harmonisation requirements, the BIS PIE taskforce report, the PMPG Hybrid Postal Address whitepaper and the EPC address guidance into a single reference.</p> <a class="btn btn-accent" href="https://ionova.ai/demo">Book a demo <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></a> </div> </section> <section class="section"> <div class="section-label">Related Terms</div> <h2 class="section-title">See also</h2> <div class="related-grid"> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/pacs-008"><h4>pacs.008</h4><p>pacs.008 (FIToFICustomerCreditTransfer) carries customer credit transfers between FIs — the MX successor to MT…</p></a> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/pain-001"><h4>pain.001</h4><p>pain.001 (CustomerCreditTransferInitiation) is the corporate payment-initiation message; production version pa…</p></a> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/cutover2026"><h4>CUTOVER2026 keyword</h4><p>CUTOVER2026 is the literal TwnNm keyword bridging in-flight transactions across the 15 November 2026 cutover. …</p></a> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/best-effort-structuring"><h4>Best-Effort Structuring</h4><p>Best-Effort Structuring is the primary transitional rule: extract TwnNm and Ctry from pre-cutover content wher…</p></a> <a class="related-card" href="/glossary/cbpr-plus"><h4>CBPR+</h4><p>CBPR+ is the SWIFT usage guideline for cross-border ISO 20022 payments, evolving via annual November Standards…</p></a> </div> </section> </article>
